BT 1 0 0 1 0 69.6000 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.2 TL (Among the many traditional art forms of Tamil Nadu, Bharatanatyam is the one that has carried our) Tj T* (culture across the centuries. It began inside the temples, where devadasis performed it as an) Tj T* (offering to the deity. The epic Silappathikaram describes classical dance in detail, and the carvings) Tj T* (on the Brihadeeswarar Temple at Thanjavur and the Chidambaram Nataraja Temple show its) Tj T* (postures in stone. In the nineteenth century, the Thanjavur Quartet organised the repertoire into the) Tj T* (form we see today.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 85.37008 559.7200 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 56.4000 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.2 TL (Traditionally, a dancer trains for many years under a guru. A performance blends nritta \(pure) Tj T* (rhythm\), nritya \(expressive storytelling\) and natya \(drama\), told through hand gestures called) Tj T* (mudras, facial expressions and Carnatic music. The dancer wears a bright silk costume, temple) Tj T* (jewellery and ankle bells called salangai. The first full solo performance, the arangetram, marks the) Tj T* (end of a student's formal training.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 85.37008 474.9200 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 69.6000 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.2 TL (Today, many young people feel the art form is old-fashioned and too expensive to learn. Modern) Tj T* (initiatives can change this. Schools and colleges can include classical dance in cultural clubs and) Tj T* (the curriculum, as institutions like Kalakshetra in Chennai already do. Online classes, recorded) Tj T* (performances and social media reels can reach learners in small towns. Festivals such as the) Tj T* (Margazhi season in Chennai give young artists a stage, and scholarships can help families who) Tj T* (cannot afford training.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 85.37008 429.7200 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.0000 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.2 TL (Bharatanatyam is more than entertainment; it is a living record of our history, music and devotion. If) Tj T* (we support it through education, technology and public platforms, the next generation will carry the) Tj T* (dancing bells forward.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
