q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.0000 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.2 TL (In conclusion, neither method is perfect alone. The best approach is a blend, where AI handles) Tj T* (routine and objective checking quickly, and teachers review complex work and guide students. This) Tj T* (combination keeps assessment fast, fair and meaningful.) Tj T* ET
