BT 1 0 0 1 0 69.6000 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.2 TL (On Bhogi, families clean their homes and throw away old things. On Thai Pongal, they draw) Tj T* (colourful kolams at the entrance and cook fresh rice and milk in a new clay pot in the open yard.) Tj T* (When the milk boils over, everyone shouts \223Pongalo Pongal!\224 The pot is decorated with turmeric) Tj T* (plants and sugarcane. The festive meal includes sakkarai pongal, venn pongal, sambar, vadai and) Tj T* (payasam, served on banana leaves. On Mattu Pongal, farmers decorate and worship their cattle,) Tj T* (and Kaanum Pongal is a day for family visits and community games.) Tj T* ET
