q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.0000 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.2 TL (In my hometown, as in many towns of Tamil Nadu, the temple car festival, or Ther Thiruvizha, is the) Tj T* (biggest event of the year. Thousands of devotees gather in the streets to watch the deity pulled in a) Tj T* (huge, richly decorated wooden chariot, called the ther.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 85.37008 211.9200 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 69.6000 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.2 TL (The festival begins with flag hoisting and several days of processions. On the car day, devotees of) Tj T* (all ages hold thick ropes and pull the heavy chariot together through the four main streets, chanting) Tj T* (prayers while drums and nadaswaram fill the air. This shared effort is a strong symbol of unity,) Tj T* (because people from every community take part. Women draw kolams on the road, and families) Tj T* (offer coconuts, bananas and flowers to the deity. Volunteers give free food such as pongal,) Tj T* (puliyodharai, curd rice and sweet payasam as prasadam, served on leaves.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 85.37008 114.3200 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 82.8000 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.2 TL (However, such a large crowd also creates problems. Single-use plastic cups, plates and bags litter) Tj T* (the streets, and loudspeakers cause noise pollution. Eco-friendly measures can solve these) Tj T* (problems. Organisers can ban single-use plastic and provide steel tumblers, banana leaves and) Tj T* (paper bags. Dustbins and waste-sorting points can be placed along the route, and volunteers can) Tj T* (collect and compost the food waste. Noise can be controlled by limiting loudspeaker volume and) Tj T* (using traditional instruments. Barricades, marked entry and exit lanes, volunteers, and first-aid) Tj T* (points can manage the crowd safely.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 85.37008 95.9200 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3.6000 Tm /F1 9.6 Tf 13.2 TL (With these steps, the festival can keep its sacred joy and remain clean and peaceful.) Tj T* ET
